(6111117, 898836, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog is wakened from pleasant nap by dragon. Was dreaming of many females tending to Grog. Foul monster breaths smoke and screams as flying overhead. Grog not happy. Grog will name dragon "Buff". Grog will capture and tame Buff. Females will be impressed, will want to bear Grog''s younglings. Enemy tribe will be scared and pay tribute to Grog. Grog is great tamer-of beasts.</td>', 'Grog is wakened from pleasant nap by dragon. Was dreaming of many females tending to Grog. Foul monster breaths smoke and screams as flying overhead. Grog not happy. Grog will name dragon "Buff". Grog will capture and tame Buff. Females will be impressed, will want to bear Grog''s younglings. Enemy tribe will be scared and pay tribute to Grog. Grog is great tamer-of beasts.', '2010-08-01 01:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
