(6111167, 900964, 104841, '<td valign="top">overall I like the shot but I think that there are some things that might be worth considering, such at that empty bit of roof on the left of frame, the fact that some of the seagulls blend into the white roof.</td>', 'overall I like the shot but I think that there are some things that might be worth considering, such at that empty bit of roof on the left of frame, the fact that some of the seagulls blend into the white roof.', '2010-08-01 02:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111169, 900878, 104841, '<td valign="top">I like how you can just make out the uniform in the back ground, but it could be missed by the casual viewer. It would have been nice if you could have got him to take of the backpack and get him a little bit sharper. Of course if this was just a candid then you cannot do that.</td>', 'I like how you can just make out the uniform in the back ground, but it could be missed by the casual viewer. It would have been nice if you could have got him to take of the backpack and get him a little bit sharper. Of course if this was just a candid then you cannot do that.', '2010-08-01 02:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6111171, 900754, 103032, '<td valign="top">A contemplative mood having the boy close his eyes (or looking down).  An angelic feel with the high key treatment.  Wonderful image.</td>', 'A contemplative mood having the boy close his eyes (or looking down).  An angelic feel with the high key treatment.  Wonderful image.', '2010-08-01 02:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
