(6111454, 899290, 23317, '<td valign="top">I hadn''t seen a rainbow in years when I saw a double rainbow the other day.  And both rainbows were end-to-end, which is unusual.  Then, the next day, I saw another one.  I guess they come in pairs.  The first day, I wished I would have had my camera with me, because they''re gone in a short time.  Very nice capture.</td>', 'I hadn''t seen a rainbow in years when I saw a double rainbow the other day.  And both rainbows were end-to-end, which is unusual.  Then, the next day, I saw another one.  I guess they come in pairs.  The first day, I wished I would have had my camera with me, because they''re gone in a short time.  Very nice capture.', '2010-08-01 10:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
