(6111934, 896454, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great time of day to photograph Perth over the Swan.<br/>The reflections are great.  The river looks so still here.<br/>A little of additional space all around the image may have helped.  I would have included some additional space on both sides to give the image a little more room.  At the moment it does feel a little squashed into the frame.<br/>The centreline is also running straight through the middle of the image, however it looks that it is just in the upper half..........this makes it feel a little unbalanced......Some additional sky above the city (upper part of the image) would have then avoided this and balanced the image more.</td>', 'Great time of day to photograph Perth over the Swan.The reflections are great.  The river looks so still here.A little of additional space all around the image may have helped.  I would have included some additional space on both sides to give the image a little more room.  At the moment it does feel a little squashed into the frame.The centreline is also running straight through the middle of the image, however it looks that it is just in the upper half..........this makes it feel a little unbalanced......Some additional sky above the city (upper part of the image) would have then avoided this and balanced the image more.', '2010-08-01 16:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
