(6111942, 899164, 96881, '<td valign="top">Firstly, and it will be mentioned by others, make sure you use the entire 800px long length when submitting.  This image here is too small to really see all of the details.  Utilise a program to resize the image to use this maximum size.  Your score will suffer significantly due to the small size.<br/> <br/>Aside from that, I like the composition.  The grass through the foreground works well, and contrasts against the yellow field of newly cut hay........</td>', 'Firstly, and it will be mentioned by others, make sure you use the entire 800px long length when submitting.  This image here is too small to really see all of the details.  Utilise a program to resize the image to use this maximum size.  Your score will suffer significantly due to the small size. Aside from that, I like the composition.  The grass through the foreground works well, and contrasts against the yellow field of newly cut hay........', '2010-08-01 16:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
