(6111958, 900051, 96881, '<td valign="top">Melbourne......the yarra.  I miss it at times......There are few cities in the world like Melbourne.<br/> <br/>Great light.  You took this at the right time to get show the lights as well as the details.  Shame about the size restriction as this would look even more impressive in larger size.  All the lines seem to lead down to Jeff''s Shed.<br/> <br/>The crop on the Crown tower at the top seems a little tight.  Just a little bit extra space there probably would have helped.</td>', 'Melbourne......the yarra.  I miss it at times......There are few cities in the world like Melbourne. Great light.  You took this at the right time to get show the lights as well as the details.  Shame about the size restriction as this would look even more impressive in larger size.  All the lines seem to lead down to Jeff''s Shed. The crop on the Crown tower at the top seems a little tight.  Just a little bit extra space there probably would have helped.', '2010-08-01 16:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
