(6112096, 899014, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great image.  Great colour through the sky.....Would have liked more of it to be visible.  I would really like to see more of the view, especially to the right side, as there looks to be more areas of interest to that side........The contrast between the snow and the sky are great........</td>', 'Great image.  Great colour through the sky.....Would have liked more of it to be visible.  I would really like to see more of the view, especially to the right side, as there looks to be more areas of interest to that side........The contrast between the snow and the sky are great........', '2010-08-01 18:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6112098, 897739, 96881, '<td valign="top">The curved earth effect here is great.  You have turned it into a feature of the photograph, where normally that level of distorsion is seen as a negative.....well done there.  <br/> <br/>However, the centre of the image does not line up with the high point, so I presume you have cropped more out from the right than the left.  This is creating a tilted feel.<br/> <br/>Also, the sky being so blown out with the sun is an unfortunate element of the image</td>', 'The curved earth effect here is great.  You have turned it into a feature of the photograph, where normally that level of distorsion is seen as a negative.....well done there.   However, the centre of the image does not line up with the high point, so I presume you have cropped more out from the right than the left.  This is creating a tilted feel. Also, the sky being so blown out with the sun is an unfortunate element of the image', '2010-08-01 18:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
