(6112151, 900106, 57447, '<td valign="top">Awesome tones.</td>', 'Awesome tones.', '2010-08-01 18:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6112154, 900704, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I like the tilt here - a straight centred composition wouldn''t work nearly so well in offering the context of the trolley and the iPod lady in the way that this image does. The conversion is superb too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing<br/> <br/>Overall: A really effective image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I like the tilt here - a straight centred composition wouldn''t work nearly so well in offering the context of the trolley and the iPod lady in the way that this image does. The conversion is superb too. Critical stuff: Nothing Overall: A really effective image.', '2010-08-01 19:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6112159, 900151, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: The flat out bizarreness of this image qualifies it for a comment in this series. Technically pretty good (see caveats below); conceptually troubling to some, the references, especially her pose are fairly brazen but I''m not one to be offended. The models are interesting, if a little glam.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Technically, I think there needs to be a bit more highlight recovery done. Also, I''m not so sure bout the foliage background.<br/> <br/>Overall: A strange image that should attract a bunch of comments. I''m not sure they''ll all be good though.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: The flat out bizarreness of this image qualifies it for a comment in this series. Technically pretty good (see caveats below); conceptually troubling to some, the references, especially her pose are fairly brazen but I''m not one to be offended. The models are interesting, if a little glam. Critical stuff: Technically, I think there needs to be a bit more highlight recovery done. Also, I''m not so sure bout the foliage background. Overall: A strange image that should attract a bunch of comments. I''m not sure they''ll all be good though.', '2010-08-01 19:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
