(6112630, 899671, 28710, '<td valign="top">The best description of my response to this is ''almost evocative''.<br/> <br/>There''s an element of context missing that just makes this pic lose any specifi meaning. There are tons of things to see in the pic, but much like a drawer filled with random odds and ends, nothing seems to relate or tell a story.<br/> <br/>That''s not blood on his shirt, it''s just a design. The ditch is tall enough that this could even be a rooftop image. But that doesn''t make any difference.<br/>The dramatic pose by the guy in red doesn''t seem to make any sense. The graffiti... The boys are too neatly attired to give any sense of danger or drama.<br/> <br/>Lots of potential, but no direction.</td>', 'The best description of my response to this is ''almost evocative''. There''s an element of context missing that just makes this pic lose any specifi meaning. There are tons of things to see in the pic, but much like a drawer filled with random odds and ends, nothing seems to relate or tell a story. That''s not blood on his shirt, it''s just a design. The ditch is tall enough that this could even be a rooftop image. But that doesn''t make any difference.The dramatic pose by the guy in red doesn''t seem to make any sense. The graffiti... The boys are too neatly attired to give any sense of danger or drama. Lots of potential, but no direction.', '2010-08-02 00:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6112633, 895065, 28710, '<td valign="top">I do like the flower petals. I don''t like the greens. Also, there''s an unusual fringing around the petals, especially on the lower right.</td>', 'I do like the flower petals. I don''t like the greens. Also, there''s an unusual fringing around the petals, especially on the lower right.', '2010-08-02 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
