(6112672, 898274, 28710, '<td valign="top">I actually really like this. I think it''s just the right amount of blur.<br/> <br/>What I would like to see a bit different is the bottom edge. A bit of lens correction might make it a bit more comfortable for me or maybe just a crop up a tiny bit.<br/> <br/>Still, the rest of the pic is excellent.</td>', 'I actually really like this. I think it''s just the right amount of blur. What I would like to see a bit different is the bottom edge. A bit of lens correction might make it a bit more comfortable for me or maybe just a crop up a tiny bit. Still, the rest of the pic is excellent.', '2010-08-02 00:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6112687, 897947, 28710, '<td valign="top">Interesting. The effect on the background looks like the bg was moving in a line. Almost like someone was moving it, rather than wind. I don''t think that was an intended effect, but it gave me a good idea and I''m going to try it!<br/> <br/>Nice.</td>', 'Interesting. The effect on the background looks like the bg was moving in a line. Almost like someone was moving it, rather than wind. I don''t think that was an intended effect, but it gave me a good idea and I''m going to try it! Nice.', '2010-08-02 00:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
