(6114019, 899134, 59796, '<td valign="top">Amazing! So many different textures and colors, presented in such beautiful light. My favorite in this round and I''m rooting for a blue ribbon for this.<br/> <br/>As I keep looking at it again and again, I feel like some space on the left will do the picture even more justice.</td>', 'Amazing! So many different textures and colors, presented in such beautiful light. My favorite in this round and I''m rooting for a blue ribbon for this. As I keep looking at it again and again, I feel like some space on the left will do the picture even more justice.', '2010-08-02 17:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
