(6114614, 896942, 30982, '<td valign="top">Possibly over-topaz''d but I''ll be darned if it doesn''t work well for this.  Wonderful tableu (or however that''s spelled.)</td>', 'Possibly over-topaz''d but I''ll be darned if it doesn''t work well for this.  Wonderful tableu (or however that''s spelled.)', '2010-08-03 01:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
