(6114628, 895203, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOVE the people in this!</td>', 'LOVE the people in this!', '2010-08-03 01:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114629, 900765, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite like the foreground bokeh to paint color on the face.  Like the acidized color scheme as well.  A different sort of portrait and very nicely done!</td>', 'Quite like the foreground bokeh to paint color on the face.  Like the acidized color scheme as well.  A different sort of portrait and very nicely done!', '2010-08-03 01:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114630, 900107, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of peace and quiet.</td>', 'Nice sense of peace and quiet.', '2010-08-03 01:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114632, 900331, 30982, '<td valign="top">Warmn and inviting - a lovely place to spend a weekend!</td>', 'Warmn and inviting - a lovely place to spend a weekend!', '2010-08-03 01:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114636, 900918, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  Great capture of the fun of the day.  I like the little one with the P&amp;S in the front!  I trust this was one of the Photowalk outings.  Fun group!</td>', 'Excellent!  Great capture of the fun of the day.  I like the little one with the P&S in the front!  I trust this was one of the Photowalk outings.  Fun group!', '2010-08-03 01:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114637, 899823, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is way too busy, and absolutely priceless.  Excellent capture!</td>', 'This is way too busy, and absolutely priceless.  Excellent capture!', '2010-08-03 01:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114639, 900535, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fascinating, and a lovely study of texture and detail.</td>', 'Fascinating, and a lovely study of texture and detail.', '2010-08-03 01:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114640, 900520, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite impressive!  I''d imagine this is awesome in person.</td>', 'Quite impressive!  I''d imagine this is awesome in person.', '2010-08-03 01:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114641, 899748, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like that up and down are not quite right here.</td>', 'I like that up and down are not quite right here.', '2010-08-03 01:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114642, 900206, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfectly titled!</td>', 'Perfectly titled!', '2010-08-03 01:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114643, 896739, 30982, '<td valign="top">A dream realized.  Love the toning, too.</td>', 'A dream realized.  Love the toning, too.', '2010-08-03 01:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114644, 900443, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bonus points for odd in general and the strangely latinized title.  AND picture in picture.  This just gets bonus points all around!</td>', 'Bonus points for odd in general and the strangely latinized title.  AND picture in picture.  This just gets bonus points all around!', '2010-08-03 01:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114645, 900909, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done B&amp;W landscape kinda thing.  Bit ''o noise in your sky, but I like the contrasts.</td>', 'Very nicely done B&W landscape kinda thing.  Bit ''o noise in your sky, but I like the contrasts.', '2010-08-03 01:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114647, 897947, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful softness and I love the movement and flow generated in the bokeh below your bloom.</td>', 'Wonderful softness and I love the movement and flow generated in the bokeh below your bloom.', '2010-08-03 01:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114648, 900789, 30982, '<td valign="top">A wall for no rhyme or reason it seems, but by gosh it is in a beautiful setting!</td>', 'A wall for no rhyme or reason it seems, but by gosh it is in a beautiful setting!', '2010-08-03 01:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114652, 900554, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very ethereal - makes one think of Lothlorien or some other haven of elves in Middle Earth.</td>', 'Very ethereal - makes one think of Lothlorien or some other haven of elves in Middle Earth.', '2010-08-03 01:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114653, 897812, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and quiet - one can smell the wet grass.</td>', 'Simple and quiet - one can smell the wet grass.', '2010-08-03 01:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114654, 898920, 30982, '<td valign="top">Love the grand scale of this, with that wee little gent over on the ladder.</td>', 'Love the grand scale of this, with that wee little gent over on the ladder.', '2010-08-03 01:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114656, 900970, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite enjoy the impressionalism of this.  My only suggestion would be to clone/fill in the whit part at the lower right side of the vase just a bit.  The explosion of color is quite lovely, though!</td>', 'Quite enjoy the impressionalism of this.  My only suggestion would be to clone/fill in the whit part at the lower right side of the vase just a bit.  The explosion of color is quite lovely, though!', '2010-08-03 01:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114672, 898690, 5822, '<td valign="top">I wish your model would have let some of her personality show. Also, I think the DOF is too narrow here as I would have liked to see the flower sharper.</td>', 'I wish your model would have let some of her personality show. Also, I think the DOF is too narrow here as I would have liked to see the flower sharper.', '2010-08-03 01:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114800, 900856, 86218, '<td valign="top">Wow element to this and I love this. The type of shot which I wish I could see and take. Simple beauty in the smallest of things that we walk by and ignore. 8</td>', 'Wow element to this and I love this. The type of shot which I wish I could see and take. Simple beauty in the smallest of things that we walk by and ignore. 8', '2010-08-03 04:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114801, 900837, 86218, '<td valign="top">How in the world did you get this light? This you Philip? Although the sky I suppose let you down here it still fits the scene and theme for this - dark mood in the mountains. I want to know all about the processing here, if I may of course. 8</td>', 'How in the world did you get this light? This you Philip? Although the sky I suppose let you down here it still fits the scene and theme for this - dark mood in the mountains. I want to know all about the processing here, if I may of course. 8', '2010-08-03 04:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114808, 899747, 104731, '<td valign="top">Stunning...</td>', 'Stunning...', '2010-08-03 04:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114830, 900970, 40391, '<td valign="top">What can I say - BEAUTIFUL!</td>', 'What can I say - BEAUTIFUL!', '2010-08-03 05:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114832, 900970, 112292, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and effect. 7</td>', 'Nice colors and effect. 7', '2010-08-03 05:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114834, 899164, 112292, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot but too small IMO.</td>', 'Wonderful shot but too small IMO.', '2010-08-03 05:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114836, 900610, 112292, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.8</td>', 'Nice portrait.8', '2010-08-03 05:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114846, 900704, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great photo but the angle world work better for me if it was slightly tighter cropped and perhaps about 10% less rotation.</td>', 'Great photo but the angle world work better for me if it was slightly tighter cropped and perhaps about 10% less rotation.', '2010-08-03 05:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114847, 900621, 40391, '<td valign="top">With that Industrial touch :-)<br/> <br/>I like the PP effect.</td>', 'With that Industrial touch :-) I like the PP effect.', '2010-08-03 05:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114848, 900727, 40391, '<td valign="top">I have never seen such a star trail shot achieve such a daylight feel. Well done.</td>', 'I have never seen such a star trail shot achieve such a daylight feel. Well done.', '2010-08-03 05:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114849, 900979, 40391, '<td valign="top">Lovely backlighting and DoF.  Which one''s Kim?</td>', 'Lovely backlighting and DoF.  Which one''s Kim?', '2010-08-03 05:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114850, 900505, 40391, '<td valign="top">A beauliful moody scene well captured.  Wise choice of B&amp;W.  I feel you could have cropped most of the sky and leave the bridge and reflection in the top and bottom third of the image.</td>', 'A beauliful moody scene well captured.  Wise choice of B&W.  I feel you could have cropped most of the sky and leave the bridge and reflection in the top and bottom third of the image.', '2010-08-03 05:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114851, 897942, 40391, '<td valign="top">What a great find! You''ve produced a powerful image that really appeals to me.</td>', 'What a great find! You''ve produced a powerful image that really appeals to me.', '2010-08-03 06:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114854, 896858, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nice DoF but you have to fix that tilted horizon - or exaggerate it even more, as the way it is it looks like an oversight.  Even though the dark blue of the upper sky looks nice I feel the image would work better with most of the sky cropped out.</td>', 'Nice DoF but you have to fix that tilted horizon - or exaggerate it even more, as the way it is it looks like an oversight.  Even though the dark blue of the upper sky looks nice I feel the image would work better with most of the sky cropped out.', '2010-08-03 06:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6114857, 900206, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great capture but I''m sure you would have preferred to have not missed the nose and beard</td>', 'Great capture but I''m sure you would have preferred to have not missed the nose and beard', '2010-08-03 06:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
