(6115532, 900982, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good effort in what looks like midday sun. Probably better than I could do in the same conditions. Lot''s of blown highlights, however. I see some effort at highlight recovery and a grayish-blue patch of her hair where it may have been taken a little too far when there was nothing there to recover.</td>', 'A good effort in what looks like midday sun. Probably better than I could do in the same conditions. Lot''s of blown highlights, however. I see some effort at highlight recovery and a grayish-blue patch of her hair where it may have been taken a little too far when there was nothing there to recover.', '2010-08-03 14:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6115544, 898751, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now, this is game for Grog! Grog is great wielder-of-club and hitter-of-things. Easily would Grog win. Would not be fair game because Grog is so great, so Grog wait outside. (Also, Grog not have small papers to trade for ticket. Female in glass cage not accept animal pelts.)</td>', 'Now, this is game for Grog! Grog is great wielder-of-club and hitter-of-things. Easily would Grog win. Would not be fair game because Grog is so great, so Grog wait outside. (Also, Grog not have small papers to trade for ticket. Female in glass cage not accept animal pelts.)', '2010-08-03 14:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6115547, 897358, 10785, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on an old dpc classic photo... I like the way you havfe the apple appearing to be floating over thebook. It adds great interest that way. A few distractin elements of the image are the smudge on the glass at upper left, the black triangle at upper right, and the book facing away from the viewer. Other than that, great use of light and shadow. I think the shadow lines going through the book help it out, especially because they are not parallel to the book. One thing I would suggest for improvement would be to use a slower shutter speed to get a darker image, but that only speaks to personal taste. There is nothing wrong with the current exposure.</td>', 'Interesting take on an old dpc classic photo... I like the way you havfe the apple appearing to be floating over thebook. It adds great interest that way. A few distractin elements of the image are the smudge on the glass at upper left, the black triangle at upper right, and the book facing away from the viewer. Other than that, great use of light and shadow. I think the shadow lines going through the book help it out, especially because they are not parallel to the book. One thing I would suggest for improvement would be to use a slower shutter speed to get a darker image, but that only speaks to personal taste. There is nothing wrong with the current exposure.', '2010-08-03 14:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6115552, 898274, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the use of slow shutter speed to create the motion blur. I think you may have left the shutter open a hair too long in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the use of slow shutter speed to create the motion blur. I think you may have left the shutter open a hair too long in my opinion.', '2010-08-03 14:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6115555, 898836, 10785, '<td valign="top">A great flying machine of the cold war era! I would rather see the orientation rotated 90 degrees right...</td>', 'A great flying machine of the cold war era! I would rather see the orientation rotated 90 degrees right...', '2010-08-03 14:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6115560, 896853, 10785, '<td valign="top">Just a hair too bright... But a gorgeous little child!</td>', 'Just a hair too bright... But a gorgeous little child!', '2010-08-03 14:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6115571, 899051, 10785, '<td valign="top">Love the composition with the line of the womans body making an agled through the photo. The lighting is very good too with the brightest part being on her belly, yet with enough light on the face. It looks to me as though there is a bit of camera shake going on, especially in the area of the face. Was this handheld??</td>', 'Love the composition with the line of the womans body making an agled through the photo. The lighting is very good too with the brightest part being on her belly, yet with enough light on the face. It looks to me as though there is a bit of camera shake going on, especially in the area of the face. Was this handheld??', '2010-08-03 14:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6115610, 900923, 83313, '<td valign="top">This just comes off somewhat soft to me. Looking at your file size, I see it is only 80k is size. You have probably lost some clarity and detail to JPEG compression. Always use the least compression/largest file size you can and still come in under the challenge size limit.</td>', 'This just comes off somewhat soft to me. Looking at your file size, I see it is only 80k is size. You have probably lost some clarity and detail to JPEG compression. Always use the least compression/largest file size you can and still come in under the challenge size limit.', '2010-08-03 15:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
