(6115925, 900878, 76335, '<td valign="top">Here''s a situation where the photo uses the title as a crutch. Haunted by what memories? Is he at a memorial? Visiting a country where he did battle? There''s no context in the photo to tell the story. And from the look on his face, I can''t tell if he''s haunted by memories or trying to remember what he had for breakfast.</td>', 'Here''s a situation where the photo uses the title as a crutch. Haunted by what memories? Is he at a memorial? Visiting a country where he did battle? There''s no context in the photo to tell the story. And from the look on his face, I can''t tell if he''s haunted by memories or trying to remember what he had for breakfast.', '2010-08-03 19:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6115926, 896290, 76335, '<td valign="top">Would be an excellent stock photo. Nicely done.</td>', 'Would be an excellent stock photo. Nicely done.', '2010-08-03 19:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6115931, 899823, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the processing, but the scene itself is irresistable.</td>', 'Not crazy about the processing, but the scene itself is irresistable.', '2010-08-03 19:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6115933, 899671, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is too cool for words.</td>', 'This is too cool for words.', '2010-08-03 19:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6115946, 898750, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I really like this shot - the coloration and light are tremendous, there are a number of compelling elements and actually, if I really look, I think there are a multitude of editing possibilities here.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really, your choices are fine. I think I''d have been tempted to crop down to the child more, taking out the dancers to the right - I think the context becomes very ambiguous than and the mystery (and thus story) of the image is enhanced.<br/> <br/>Overall: A highly interesting image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I really like this shot - the coloration and light are tremendous, there are a number of compelling elements and actually, if I really look, I think there are a multitude of editing possibilities here. Critical stuff: Nothing really, your choices are fine. I think I''d have been tempted to crop down to the child more, taking out the dancers to the right - I think the context becomes very ambiguous than and the mystery (and thus story) of the image is enhanced. Overall: A highly interesting image.', '2010-08-03 19:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
