(6116346, 900783, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very dream like. There is a lot of mystery added by using such a long exposure. I do wish there were more color. Maybe just upping the saturation would bring it out.</td>', 'Very dream like. There is a lot of mystery added by using such a long exposure. I do wish there were more color. Maybe just upping the saturation would bring it out.', '2010-08-03 23:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
