(6117774, 898750, 110023, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for these types of shots. Love the candidness, rays of light, and sheer joy of the children. The fact you have clarity in some areas and just a slight silhouette in others adds to the appeal. NICE!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for these types of shots. Love the candidness, rays of light, and sheer joy of the children. The fact you have clarity in some areas and just a slight silhouette in others adds to the appeal. NICE!', '2010-08-04 13:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117776, 900948, 23484, '<td valign="top">Perfect angle.</td>', 'Perfect angle.', '2010-08-04 13:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117778, 898274, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is great. I love the colors and the sharpness.</td>', 'This is great. I love the colors and the sharpness.', '2010-08-04 13:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117780, 899014, 110023, '<td valign="top">Beautiful view and I can''t imagine what it was like to be standing in that spot seeing the view in person. Must have been breathtaking! Great shot!</td>', 'Beautiful view and I can''t imagine what it was like to be standing in that spot seeing the view in person. Must have been breathtaking! Great shot!', '2010-08-04 13:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117782, 900960, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very neat abstract shot. I like that all the shapes are somewhat different.</td>', 'Very neat abstract shot. I like that all the shapes are somewhat different.', '2010-08-04 13:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117783, 897986, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on the lighting.</td>', 'Excellent job on the lighting.', '2010-08-04 13:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117784, 897942, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. It''s so dominating looking and the high contrast is very nice.</td>', 'Great perspective. It''s so dominating looking and the high contrast is very nice.', '2010-08-04 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117786, 900442, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and very interesting colors.</td>', 'Excellent composition and very interesting colors.', '2010-08-04 13:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117791, 900756, 23484, '<td valign="top">The softness really adds to this image. Nice exposure.</td>', 'The softness really adds to this image. Nice exposure.', '2010-08-04 13:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117793, 899715, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very serene image. You can just stare at this and relax.</td>', 'Very serene image. You can just stare at this and relax.', '2010-08-04 13:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117798, 898825, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the processing. I like the subdued saturation.</td>', 'Nice job on the processing. I like the subdued saturation.', '2010-08-04 13:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117801, 900649, 110023, '<td valign="top">Thanks goodness for shots like this! Nice to get away from the typical DPC challenge shot with high contrast, HDR, or a popular voter subject, etc. Kudos to you...and I''m giving this a high score for being well shot and interesting to look at! :)</td>', 'Thanks goodness for shots like this! Nice to get away from the typical DPC challenge shot with high contrast, HDR, or a popular voter subject, etc. Kudos to you...and I''m giving this a high score for being well shot and interesting to look at! :)', '2010-08-04 13:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117806, 900331, 110023, '<td valign="top">This just makes me want that fisheye lens even more! Nice capture and I really like yoru title.</td>', 'This just makes me want that fisheye lens even more! Nice capture and I really like yoru title.', '2010-08-04 13:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117807, 899725, 110023, '<td valign="top">Great image and I live your perspective! Beautiful to look at.</td>', 'Great image and I live your perspective! Beautiful to look at.', '2010-08-04 13:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117808, 900925, 110023, '<td valign="top">Anything with bacon gets my vote! Looks yummy :)</td>', 'Anything with bacon gets my vote! Looks yummy :)', '2010-08-04 13:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117815, 900751, 110023, '<td valign="top">A high key image done well! I really like the subtle hint of color too. I am interested how you edited this. Great job!</td>', 'A high key image done well! I really like the subtle hint of color too. I am interested how you edited this. Great job!', '2010-08-04 13:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117820, 900605, 110023, '<td valign="top">Awesome portrait shot! I like the set-up as the location doesn''t take away from the model. NICE!</td>', 'Awesome portrait shot! I like the set-up as the location doesn''t take away from the model. NICE!', '2010-08-04 14:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117826, 899823, 110023, '<td valign="top">The editing works great with your composition. I like the quirkiness of the whole image. How great it is to see something different. NICE!</td>', 'The editing works great with your composition. I like the quirkiness of the whole image. How great it is to see something different. NICE!', '2010-08-04 14:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117843, 900443, 84323, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.  I love your color pallette and the doll house.  Why did you decide to make the right so much darker, instead of cropping it out?  It appears to have the sme effect, i.e. to push the composition to the left.  Anyway, great photo.</td>', 'This is beautiful.  I love your color pallette and the doll house.  Why did you decide to make the right so much darker, instead of cropping it out?  It appears to have the sme effect, i.e. to push the composition to the left.  Anyway, great photo.', '2010-08-04 14:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117845, 899747, 92577, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2010-08-04 14:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117848, 900148, 92577, '<td valign="top">cute (could possibly benefit from a little noise reduction on the background)</td>', 'cute (could possibly benefit from a little noise reduction on the background)', '2010-08-04 14:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117850, 900837, 92577, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2010-08-04 14:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6117854, 898163, 92577, '<td valign="top">expression and impact are both strong. (selection round top of head is very slight weakness)good luck</td>', 'expression and impact are both strong. (selection round top of head is very slight weakness)good luck', '2010-08-04 14:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118132, 897358, 92577, '<td valign="top">Is there a sheet of glass involved here? Great effect - good luck</td>', 'Is there a sheet of glass involved here? Great effect - good luck', '2010-08-04 18:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118153, 895155, 92577, '<td valign="top">found myself captivated by this - good luck</td>', 'found myself captivated by this - good luck', '2010-08-04 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118167, 899273, 76335, '<td valign="top">What a lucky capture -- or not, if you camped for this one. Good work in any case.</td>', 'What a lucky capture -- or not, if you camped for this one. Good work in any case.', '2010-08-04 18:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118170, 900636, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The background bokeh is perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful. The background bokeh is perfect.', '2010-08-04 18:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118174, 900618, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I''m sure he''s smiling at me.</td>', 'Nicely done. I''m sure he''s smiling at me.', '2010-08-04 18:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118175, 900767, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed. I kind of wish the building on the left weren''t clipped.</td>', 'Nicely exposed. I kind of wish the building on the left weren''t clipped.', '2010-08-04 18:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118178, 899554, 76335, '<td valign="top">That''s incredible. Once in a lifetime for sure.</td>', 'That''s incredible. Once in a lifetime for sure.', '2010-08-04 18:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118180, 899014, 92577, '<td valign="top">wonderful - (although I wish there was more sky visible)</td>', 'wonderful - (although I wish there was more sky visible)', '2010-08-04 18:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118253, 900180, 51747, '<td valign="top">A pretty place and a good eye to see this. To me, the shot is the mirrored reflection. The lower part of the image is unnecessary.</td>', 'A pretty place and a good eye to see this. To me, the shot is the mirrored reflection. The lower part of the image is unnecessary.', '2010-08-04 19:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118324, 900004, 46918, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a snapshot....but I love the sky.</td>', 'Looks more like a snapshot....but I love the sky.', '2010-08-04 20:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118334, 900066, 46918, '<td valign="top">I like your "foxy lady". Great detail is always a plus. She is also in a very nice pose.</td>', 'I like your "foxy lady". Great detail is always a plus. She is also in a very nice pose.', '2010-08-04 20:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118341, 900581, 23484, '<td valign="top">Neat concept and good job with the idea.</td>', 'Neat concept and good job with the idea.', '2010-08-04 20:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118346, 900918, 23484, '<td valign="top">Where did you find that group?</td>', 'Where did you find that group?', '2010-08-04 20:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118347, 899094, 46918, '<td valign="top">It would have been nice if the tip of the wing had not been cut off.</td>', 'It would have been nice if the tip of the wing had not been cut off.', '2010-08-04 20:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118348, 900975, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and interesting pose. Excellent job on the processing.</td>', 'Nice composition and interesting pose. Excellent job on the processing.', '2010-08-04 20:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118349, 900850, 23484, '<td valign="top">Neat symmetry.</td>', 'Neat symmetry.', '2010-08-04 20:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118351, 899725, 23484, '<td valign="top">The composition on this is perfect. I like the nose of the boat in the foreground.</td>', 'The composition on this is perfect. I like the nose of the boat in the foreground.', '2010-08-04 20:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118353, 900722, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the blue color tone and great contrast.</td>', 'I like the blue color tone and great contrast.', '2010-08-04 20:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118384, 899085, 76335, '<td valign="top">That reflection is unreal. Great work.</td>', 'That reflection is unreal. Great work.', '2010-08-04 21:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118385, 897266, 76335, '<td valign="top">An effective illusion -- like summer itself.</td>', 'An effective illusion -- like summer itself.', '2010-08-04 21:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118386, 900351, 76335, '<td valign="top">Feels like heaven. Beautiful, beautiful work.</td>', 'Feels like heaven. Beautiful, beautiful work.', '2010-08-04 21:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118445, 900596, 99710, '<td valign="top">amazing colors!</td>', 'amazing colors!', '2010-08-04 22:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118447, 900970, 99710, '<td valign="top">beautiful abstract work.</td>', 'beautiful abstract work.', '2010-08-04 22:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118472, 900892, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of colors and lighting. It''s cool how his eyeball is bright red.</td>', 'Nice contrast of colors and lighting. It''s cool how his eyeball is bright red.', '2010-08-04 22:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118475, 900941, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great perspective. Good processing (bringing out details without overdoing it). I would have liked the photo to be larger so I could see even more details.</td>', 'Great perspective. Good processing (bringing out details without overdoing it). I would have liked the photo to be larger so I could see even more details.', '2010-08-04 22:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118477, 900755, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great clarity to this shot. Nice choice in time of day, as the lighting is nicely diffused.</td>', 'Great clarity to this shot. Nice choice in time of day, as the lighting is nicely diffused.', '2010-08-04 22:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118495, 900980, 83313, '<td valign="top">Creepy, but a parent is not intimidated.</td>', 'Creepy, but a parent is not intimidated.', '2010-08-04 22:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118500, 897358, 83313, '<td valign="top">Well, that''s a nice change of pace from using a ring!</td>', 'Well, that''s a nice change of pace from using a ring!', '2010-08-04 22:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118503, 900867, 99710, '<td valign="top">one of two photos that I gave a 10. great work.</td>', 'one of two photos that I gave a 10. great work.', '2010-08-04 22:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118504, 899725, 99710, '<td valign="top">my other 10, great perspective.</td>', 'my other 10, great perspective.', '2010-08-04 22:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118506, 900871, 86799, '<td valign="top">How can something so simple and mundane be beautiful?  Just like this.  Well done!</td>', 'How can something so simple and mundane be beautiful?  Just like this.  Well done!', '2010-08-04 22:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118508, 900875, 83313, '<td valign="top">A little too much noise reduction or something is going on here. All the detail on the aircraft is obscured. Perhaps this was an extreme crop. Great perspective, regardless.</td>', 'A little too much noise reduction or something is going on here. All the detail on the aircraft is obscured. Perhaps this was an extreme crop. Great perspective, regardless.', '2010-08-04 22:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118511, 900932, 86799, '<td valign="top">Frame is a bit much, IMO.  Takes attention away from the pic.</td>', 'Frame is a bit much, IMO.  Takes attention away from the pic.', '2010-08-04 22:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118520, 899748, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great details on the focused balloon. It''s an interesting perspective you chose, being both sideways and bottom up.</td>', 'Great details on the focused balloon. It''s an interesting perspective you chose, being both sideways and bottom up.', '2010-08-04 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118522, 900789, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice details here. There is a lot of nice color, although the orange looks like it might be over-saturated slightly. This is a really cool scene!</td>', 'Nice details here. There is a lot of nice color, although the orange looks like it might be over-saturated slightly. This is a really cool scene!', '2010-08-04 22:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118524, 900532, 114225, '<td valign="top">Excellent clarity in this photo. I like how the lighting reflecting off the water droplets is causing starbursts.</td>', 'Excellent clarity in this photo. I like how the lighting reflecting off the water droplets is causing starbursts.', '2010-08-04 22:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118533, 896858, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, angle of subject, and depth of field. The horizon is slightly off level, but that''s an afterthought in this image.</td>', 'I like the lighting, angle of subject, and depth of field. The horizon is slightly off level, but that''s an afterthought in this image.', '2010-08-04 22:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118534, 900331, 114225, '<td valign="top">It is cool how much of the room you can see with a lens like this, I''m just not a fan of the distorted room look.</td>', 'It is cool how much of the room you can see with a lens like this, I''m just not a fan of the distorted room look.', '2010-08-04 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118536, 900765, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool portrait. The color of the background really adds to the calmness of this photo. Great composition as well.</td>', 'Very cool portrait. The color of the background really adds to the calmness of this photo. Great composition as well.', '2010-08-04 23:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118541, 900910, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait. Good placement of the subject and use of negative space. I bet the clothes were super colorful, and I think I would have liked to see that instead of B&amp;W for this shot.</td>', 'Very nice portrait. Good placement of the subject and use of negative space. I bet the clothes were super colorful, and I think I would have liked to see that instead of B&W for this shot.', '2010-08-04 23:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118543, 897792, 114225, '<td valign="top">Funny, I think this photo could have been much better without seeing the spray bottles and the goofy title. It''s still very well done.</td>', 'Funny, I think this photo could have been much better without seeing the spray bottles and the goofy title. It''s still very well done.', '2010-08-04 23:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118545, 900879, 114225, '<td valign="top">I love the colors of this shot. Did you use some type of filter? I bet this could be a good candidate for "fake HDR" to bring out the details in the dark areas.</td>', 'I love the colors of this shot. Did you use some type of filter? I bet this could be a good candidate for "fake HDR" to bring out the details in the dark areas.', '2010-08-04 23:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118547, 900355, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great catch. Nice clarity and depth of field.</td>', 'Great catch. Nice clarity and depth of field.', '2010-08-04 23:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118550, 900792, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a perverted bee! :)<br/>Good amount of details in this photo, although the noise is taking away from the overall sharpness a bit.</td>', 'What a perverted bee! :)Good amount of details in this photo, although the noise is taking away from the overall sharpness a bit.', '2010-08-04 23:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118552, 897938, 114225, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done portrait: great pose and eye clarity. I really like the muted colors you used.</td>', 'Wonderfully done portrait: great pose and eye clarity. I really like the muted colors you used.', '2010-08-04 23:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118554, 900535, 114225, '<td valign="top">Cool capture of a fine art. Nice job capturing so many details and textures.</td>', 'Cool capture of a fine art. Nice job capturing so many details and textures.', '2010-08-04 23:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118556, 896480, 114225, '<td valign="top">This photo is very nicely balanced. The rays of light add extra interest, and the contrasting colors bring out many details.</td>', 'This photo is very nicely balanced. The rays of light add extra interest, and the contrasting colors bring out many details.', '2010-08-04 23:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118557, 900556, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool use of light painting. Great job balance the exposure from the painting and the natural light in the sky.</td>', 'This is a really cool use of light painting. Great job balance the exposure from the painting and the natural light in the sky.', '2010-08-04 23:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118564, 900754, 46918, '<td valign="top">I would have atleast liked to see the outline of the face on the left hand part of the pic....Otherwise good shot</td>', 'I would have atleast liked to see the outline of the face on the left hand part of the pic....Otherwise good shot', '2010-08-04 23:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118565, 900948, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good catch. Funny to see another potential photographer in the middle of the street. Only thing I wish was different is the motion blur of the moving cars.</td>', 'Good catch. Funny to see another potential photographer in the middle of the street. Only thing I wish was different is the motion blur of the moving cars.', '2010-08-04 23:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118566, 897712, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great amount of color, and nice use of shoreline to add perspective.</td>', 'Great amount of color, and nice use of shoreline to add perspective.', '2010-08-04 23:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118568, 900887, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like this. So many elements to look at, from the grass, to the sky, to the reflection, and finally the silhouette hills.</td>', 'I really like this. So many elements to look at, from the grass, to the sky, to the reflection, and finally the silhouette hills.', '2010-08-04 23:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118569, 900556, 60047, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. You''ve painted the rocks with light - but how did you do the blue smoke? Great stuff!</td>', 'I really like this shot. You''ve painted the rocks with light - but how did you do the blue smoke? Great stuff!', '2010-08-04 23:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118570, 900849, 60047, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the deep greens interact with the yellow and the browns. Nice work.</td>', 'I really like the way the deep greens interact with the yellow and the browns. Nice work.', '2010-08-04 23:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118571, 900670, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really nice colors and lots of great textures in this shot.</td>', 'Really nice colors and lots of great textures in this shot.', '2010-08-04 23:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118574, 898163, 60047, '<td valign="top">Focus un the right spot - but what is that reflection in his cornea?</td>', 'Focus un the right spot - but what is that reflection in his cornea?', '2010-08-04 23:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118576, 900858, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great textures. Could benefit from a deeper DOF via a smaller aperture.</td>', 'Great textures. Could benefit from a deeper DOF via a smaller aperture.', '2010-08-04 23:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118591, 896276, 60047, '<td valign="top">Strong lavenders. Nice sky.</td>', 'Strong lavenders. Nice sky.', '2010-08-04 23:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118594, 898751, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great photojournalistic shot.</td>', 'Great photojournalistic shot.', '2010-08-04 23:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118603, 900534, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. The clarity and details are fantastic. Good balance to the composition.</td>', 'Very nice photo. The clarity and details are fantastic. Good balance to the composition.', '2010-08-04 23:32:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6118605, 900510, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very good shot. The amount of detail in the feathers is fantastic.</td>', 'Very good shot. The amount of detail in the feathers is fantastic.', '2010-08-04 23:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118606, 900766, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cute! Good lighting, composition, and colors.</td>', 'Very cute! Good lighting, composition, and colors.', '2010-08-04 23:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118607, 898009, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is really well done. Love the look on the model''s face. Nice tones (but don''t go any warmer). I know I''m probably showing my age with this question - why the tilt?</td>', 'This is really well done. Love the look on the model''s face. Nice tones (but don''t go any warmer). I know I''m probably showing my age with this question - why the tilt?', '2010-08-04 23:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118609, 895014, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice job getting a bit of shoreline in with the sky. It''s interesting how there is a bit of light on the water and against the rock point.</td>', 'Nice job getting a bit of shoreline in with the sky. It''s interesting how there is a bit of light on the water and against the rock point.', '2010-08-04 23:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118610, 900970, 60047, '<td valign="top">I normally do not like abstracts. This is really well done. Nice job. Great colors. Monet would be proud!</td>', 'I normally do not like abstracts. This is really well done. Nice job. Great colors. Monet would be proud!', '2010-08-04 23:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118613, 900528, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very classic shot. The black and white is very well done (full range from deep black to bright white).</td>', 'Very classic shot. The black and white is very well done (full range from deep black to bright white).', '2010-08-04 23:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118615, 900351, 110930, '<td valign="top">The white water passing over the black shale creates a rich composition coupled with the deep green of the plants. The setting draws the viewer into the experience of the moment. The exposure is excellent in my view. One suggestion for editing would be to perhaps lower the exposure in the sky above the falls just a bit so it doesn''t compete with the white of the waterfall. Beautiful capture.</td>', 'The white water passing over the black shale creates a rich composition coupled with the deep green of the plants. The setting draws the viewer into the experience of the moment. The exposure is excellent in my view. One suggestion for editing would be to perhaps lower the exposure in the sky above the falls just a bit so it doesn''t compete with the white of the waterfall. Beautiful capture.', '2010-08-04 23:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118618, 900556, 72670, '<td valign="top">I really like the originality and the effect. this would be so much more appealing with a different background.</td>', 'I really like the originality and the effect. this would be so much more appealing with a different background.', '2010-08-04 23:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118622, 899336, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the general idea behind this shot. HOwever, I feel that the red is a bit over-saturated, creating a very un-natural feeling.</td>', 'I like the general idea behind this shot. HOwever, I feel that the red is a bit over-saturated, creating a very un-natural feeling.', '2010-08-04 23:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118623, 900963, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp focus and great detail in the whites. These can be tough to capture and you''ve done very well. The only negative is the fact that he is on the ground - doesn''t seem right. But this isn''t that big of a negative to me. (BTW- I''m an Eagle junkie who has captured a shot very similar to yours).</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp focus and great detail in the whites. These can be tough to capture and you''ve done very well. The only negative is the fact that he is on the ground - doesn''t seem right. But this isn''t that big of a negative to me. (BTW- I''m an Eagle junkie who has captured a shot very similar to yours).', '2010-08-04 23:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6118624, 900610, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Would have been even better to have had the focus spot on his eyes.. nice detail - a smaller aperture would have revealed even more detail &amp; DOF.</td>', 'Nice capture. Would have been even better to have had the focus spot on his eyes.. nice detail - a smaller aperture would have revealed even more detail & DOF.', '2010-08-04 23:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
