(6120625, 900639, 10785, '<td valign="top">It looks like the point of focus is midway between the horse and the woman. you can see the bridle in front of the hand on the left side is clearly in focus. I would rather see the horse or the woman as the point of focus.</td>', 'It looks like the point of focus is midway between the horse and the woman. you can see the bridle in front of the hand on the left side is clearly in focus. I would rather see the horse or the woman as the point of focus.', '2010-08-06 13:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
