(6120759, 900964, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: This is an unusual composition with bold use of negative space, I like the contrast and the coloration too. The one gull with the stretched-out wings offers an effective anchor for the eye to wander from.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Not much - intrinsic interest in the scene is on the low side but I do like what you''ve done with it,<br/> <br/>Overall: A very nice Free Study offering.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: This is an unusual composition with bold use of negative space, I like the contrast and the coloration too. The one gull with the stretched-out wings offers an effective anchor for the eye to wander from. Critical stuff: Not much - intrinsic interest in the scene is on the low side but I do like what you''ve done with it, Overall: A very nice Free Study offering.', '2010-08-06 16:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6120763, 900726, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I certainly like the idea behind the image and I like the characters in the story in this scene - the shadows are a really effective element to the image too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I think your lined up composition - lady, post, man doesn''t serve the image that well - an image 1 second before or after this frame may have given a more pleasing composition. Also, perhaps I''ve been indoctrinated, but this feels like it would be better in monochrome.<br/> <br/>Overall: I do like it, I just wish I liked it just a bit more.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I certainly like the idea behind the image and I like the characters in the story in this scene - the shadows are a really effective element to the image too. Critical stuff: I think your lined up composition - lady, post, man doesn''t serve the image that well - an image 1 second before or after this frame may have given a more pleasing composition. Also, perhaps I''ve been indoctrinated, but this feels like it would be better in monochrome. Overall: I do like it, I just wish I liked it just a bit more.', '2010-08-06 16:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6120766, 900385, 103032, '<td valign="top">Unique chess pieces.  I like the POV and the lighting resulting in the shadows and highlights, gives this a "larger than life" feel.  You obviously put some thought into your composition in filling the frame with the blue pieces and their shadows but also composed the opposing/green pieces in between the spaces between the foreground with the shallow DOF...  The colors (blues and greens) are great, yet the lighting and composition gives this image a lot of tension.  On second and multiple looks after, I really like this pic.  Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Unique chess pieces.  I like the POV and the lighting resulting in the shadows and highlights, gives this a "larger than life" feel.  You obviously put some thought into your composition in filling the frame with the blue pieces and their shadows but also composed the opposing/green pieces in between the spaces between the foreground with the shallow DOF...  The colors (blues and greens) are great, yet the lighting and composition gives this image a lot of tension.  On second and multiple looks after, I really like this pic.  Hope it does well for you.', '2010-08-06 16:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6120772, 896739, 117494, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I like what you did with composition, it takes time to get what''s happening.</td>', 'Great idea! I like what you did with composition, it takes time to get what''s happening.', '2010-08-06 16:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
