(6121373, 900970, 5822, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this abstract win a ribbon. It''s beautiful and I hope you''ve included the technique in the photographer''s comments section. I can see this hanging on a wall and the only critique I have is I wish you had included a border to impart that usage. 10 from me.</td>', 'I would love to see this abstract win a ribbon. It''s beautiful and I hope you''ve included the technique in the photographer''s comments section. I can see this hanging on a wall and the only critique I have is I wish you had included a border to impart that usage. 10 from me.', '2010-08-07 02:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
