(6121376, 900443, 5822, '<td valign="top">This photograph really has a hold on me, especially the way the manequin appears to be staring straight at me, the viewer. If my interpretation is correct it has a humorous message and you''ve made the DPC voter the diety. Would have been great in Fine Arts challenge but I say bravo to you and well done.</td>', 'This photograph really has a hold on me, especially the way the manequin appears to be staring straight at me, the viewer. If my interpretation is correct it has a humorous message and you''ve made the DPC voter the diety. Would have been great in Fine Arts challenge but I say bravo to you and well done.', '2010-08-07 02:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
