(6121380, 900907, 5822, '<td valign="top">Terrific detail and processing. Light and color is great and I really like what you''ve done with the wire cage. This has an illustration quality to it. I think I would have cropped out about 2" on the right side so the bird isn''t so centered.</td>', 'Terrific detail and processing. Light and color is great and I really like what you''ve done with the wire cage. This has an illustration quality to it. I think I would have cropped out about 2" on the right side so the bird isn''t so centered.', '2010-08-07 03:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
