(6122686, 900497, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a brilliant capture. I rated this pic the highest in my voting and it''s a first for me to do so on a flower. I thought I went a bit off my rockers but seeing it now on the front page is a relief..because this is really good. Congrats on the ribbon to</td>', 'Congrats on a brilliant capture. I rated this pic the highest in my voting and it''s a first for me to do so on a flower. I thought I went a bit off my rockers but seeing it now on the front page is a relief..because this is really good. Congrats on the ribbon to', '2010-08-08 03:10:44.000000', NULL, 0),
