(6122688, 899800, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pixelpig:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations Judi, this is gonna look soooo good on your portfolio page!  It sure looks good on the front page doesn''t it! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Except it didn''t score high enough to be on my profile page.  :(<br/> <br/>But it does feel good to have it on the front page.  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I see it on your profile page - is it just about the number you choose to see displayed?<br/> <br/>Well done on the blue Judi, it is a truly excellent capture.</td>', 'Originally posted by Judi: Originally posted by pixelpig: Congratulations Judi, this is gonna look soooo good on your portfolio page!  It sure looks good on the front page doesn''t it!   Except it didn''t score high enough to be on my profile page.  :( But it does feel good to have it on the front page.  :)   I see it on your profile page - is it just about the number you choose to see displayed? Well done on the blue Judi, it is a truly excellent capture.', '2010-08-08 03:25:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6122690, 899800, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by paulbtlw:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pixelpig:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations Judi, this is gonna look soooo good on your portfolio page!  It sure looks good on the front page doesn''t it! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Except it didn''t score high enough to be on my profile page.  :(<br/> <br/>But it does feel good to have it on the front page.  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I see it on your profile page - is it just about the number you choose to see displayed?<br/> <br/>Well done on the blue Judi, it is a truly excellent capture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Of course...doh!  I opted to see the top 6 images...oh well.</td>', 'Originally posted by paulbtlw: Originally posted by Judi: Originally posted by pixelpig: Congratulations Judi, this is gonna look soooo good on your portfolio page!  It sure looks good on the front page doesn''t it!   Except it didn''t score high enough to be on my profile page.  :( But it does feel good to have it on the front page.  :)   I see it on your profile page - is it just about the number you choose to see displayed? Well done on the blue Judi, it is a truly excellent capture.   Of course...doh!  I opted to see the top 6 images...oh well.', '2010-08-08 03:33:04.000000', NULL, 0),
