(6122698, 899800, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your FS Blue. Nice action shot and I think all who saw this really felt bad for this poor guy. Then again, if you are into this, Im not sure you should feel sorry for them..except the poor wife who needs to clean that white shirt. I suppose white does make you more visible when they have to pic up your pieces afterwards. Congrats again</td>', 'Congrats on your FS Blue. Nice action shot and I think all who saw this really felt bad for this poor guy. Then again, if you are into this, Im not sure you should feel sorry for them..except the poor wife who needs to clean that white shirt. I suppose white does make you more visible when they have to pic up your pieces afterwards. Congrats again', '2010-08-08 03:48:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6122702, 899800, 40718, '<td valign="top">Uh oh.  I just missed and guess you are tied again. :)  Nice shot.  Great to see an action shot win a FS.</td>', 'Uh oh.  I just missed and guess you are tied again. :)  Nice shot.  Great to see an action shot win a FS.', '2010-08-08 03:52:23.000000', NULL, 0),
