(6122718, 899800, 59029, '<td valign="top">It''s high time an action shot won an FS, and not surprised it was you to do it, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Judi</a>!  Great work and huge congrats! :-)</td>', 'It''s high time an action shot won an FS, and not surprised it was you to do it,  Judi!  Great work and huge congrats! :-)', '2010-08-08 04:16:30.000000', NULL, 0),
