(6122777, 900862, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like to look at the lower scoring photos in order to learn more about what mistakes to avoid.  In this case, I am toally lost.  This is a great shot, well composed with a excellent use of color and DOF.  Not sure what the rest of the voters did not like.  Must have been the subject, I guess.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-08-08 06:31:40.</i></td>', 'I like to look at the lower scoring photos in order to learn more about what mistakes to avoid.  In this case, I am toally lost.  This is a great shot, well composed with a excellent use of color and DOF.  Not sure what the rest of the voters did not like.  Must have been the subject, I guess.', '2010-08-08 07:30:32.000000', '2010-08-08 07:31:40.000000', 0),
(6122779, 899800, 43594, '<td valign="top">superb, congrats!</td>', 'superb, congrats!', '2010-08-08 07:46:38.000000', NULL, 0),
