(6123082, 899134, 45187, '<td valign="top">Hi.  Just wanted to say that this is (a) a really great photo, and (b) it inspired me to go back and look through the pictures I took when I visited the park 3 years ago.  I like your shot better than <a href="//samchadwick.zenfolio.com/northamerica/e2e497707" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">the one I came away with</a>.  I didn''t have a full frame camera back then and I think the extra coverage of your shot makes all the difference.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Hi.  Just wanted to say that this is (a) a really great photo, and (b) it inspired me to go back and look through the pictures I took when I visited the park 3 years ago.  I like your shot better than the one I came away with.  I didn''t have a full frame camera back then and I think the extra coverage of your shot makes all the difference.  Nicely done.', '2010-08-08 14:19:06.000000', NULL, 0),
