(6123144, 900208, 65234, '<td valign="top">Seriously underrated!  I wonder how many people looked closely enough to see the perfect little bud in the drop.  Assuming that''s a live caterpillar who could wander a millimeter in any direction and throw off the reflection at any time, this was a really difficult shot to pull off.</td>', 'Seriously underrated!  I wonder how many people looked closely enough to see the perfect little bud in the drop.  Assuming that''s a live caterpillar who could wander a millimeter in any direction and throw off the reflection at any time, this was a really difficult shot to pull off.', '2010-08-08 15:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
