(6123400, 899550, 60862, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  I got a shot this month of some kind of gull with a squid in its mouth, but it was probably 30 feet up.  It made for a shot I like, but its relatively small size in the original meant I couldn''t crop it nearly as much as this to make it as large in the frame.  Congrats on the shot, score, and rank!</td>', 'Fantastic!  I got a shot this month of some kind of gull with a squid in its mouth, but it was probably 30 feet up.  It made for a shot I like, but its relatively small size in the original meant I couldn''t crop it nearly as much as this to make it as large in the frame.  Congrats on the shot, score, and rank!', '2010-08-08 19:00:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6123402, 900726, 50695, '<td valign="top">Not only that, you''re at the museum that holds Duchamp''s masterpiece, "The Bride Stripped Bare by Her Bachelors, Even." You''ve reversed the position of bride and bachelor, but the composition has some striking similarities. Whatever those white dots are correspond to the "shots" that the bachelors take at the bride (always missing) ... and the broom is like the machinery that the bachelors use. You even have the same counterclockwise movement.</td>', 'Not only that, you''re at the museum that holds Duchamp''s masterpiece, "The Bride Stripped Bare by Her Bachelors, Even." You''ve reversed the position of bride and bachelor, but the composition has some striking similarities. Whatever those white dots are correspond to the "shots" that the bachelors take at the bride (always missing) ... and the broom is like the machinery that the bachelors use. You even have the same counterclockwise movement.', '2010-08-08 19:01:14.000000', NULL, 0),
