(6123798, 899134, 47906, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the top 20 finish, I really love the color of blue in the final pool, it just really catches the eye. I really love the tones and details within this shot, I do like the autumn look but I think it would look jsut as beautiful in green hue as the green would contrast the the rocky cliff nicely. The rocks provided a great amount of depth on this as well. I didnt get to yours in the free study, but it would have scored high with me cause well I love waterfalls! I probably would have given this an 8. Great Shot.</td>', 'Congrats on the top 20 finish, I really love the color of blue in the final pool, it just really catches the eye. I really love the tones and details within this shot, I do like the autumn look but I think it would look jsut as beautiful in green hue as the green would contrast the the rocky cliff nicely. The rocks provided a great amount of depth on this as well. I didnt get to yours in the free study, but it would have scored high with me cause well I love waterfalls! I probably would have given this an 8. Great Shot.', '2010-08-08 22:18:38.000000', NULL, 0),
