(6124332, 899800, 108700, '<td valign="top">hehe, this not only has the top score for this lens, but you also hold 11 of the top 15 scores for this lens, very nice mate, beautiful shot.</td>', 'hehe, this not only has the top score for this lens, but you also hold 11 of the top 15 scores for this lens, very nice mate, beautiful shot.', '2010-08-09 08:35:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6124334, 900379, 80908, '<td valign="top">Yet another example of a really good shot getting hammered because the voters are squeamish about the subect matter. Sorry about that! I gave this a 9 and reckon it should have finished at least a full point higher.</td>', 'Yet another example of a really good shot getting hammered because the voters are squeamish about the subect matter. Sorry about that! I gave this a 9 and reckon it should have finished at least a full point higher.', '2010-08-09 08:42:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6124337, 900816, 80908, '<td valign="top">This was one of only 5 ''9''s I gave out this challenge (no 10s). I think it is beautifully composed, simple and with great colour. I didn''t necessarily expect the DPC voter to like it, but sub-5 is just wrong.<br/> <br/>Great shot!</td>', 'This was one of only 5 ''9''s I gave out this challenge (no 10s). I think it is beautifully composed, simple and with great colour. I didn''t necessarily expect the DPC voter to like it, but sub-5 is just wrong. Great shot!', '2010-08-09 08:54:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6124370, 900379, 101668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by FrankRobinson:</b></div><hr/><i> Yet another example of a really good shot getting hammered because the voters are squeamish about the subect matter. Sorry about that! I gave this a 9 and reckon it should have finished at least a full point higher. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you Frank, and yes not your ordinary pretty landscape picture but photojournalism. I refuse to be put in a box just for a high score although I prefer to shoot landscapes I shoot as many subjects as possible. Thank you once again for your comment.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by FrankRobinson: Yet another example of a really good shot getting hammered because the voters are squeamish about the subect matter. Sorry about that! I gave this a 9 and reckon it should have finished at least a full point higher.  Thank you Frank, and yes not your ordinary pretty landscape picture but photojournalism. I refuse to be put in a box just for a high score although I prefer to shoot landscapes I shoot as many subjects as possible. Thank you once again for your comment.', '2010-08-09 10:06:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6124374, 900379, 101668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RianBotes:</b></div><hr/><i> Goed gesien en goeie werk hier. Ek hou van die beligting en kleure werk goed saam. Sommiges mag dalk se dat die "hot spots'' op regterkant trek aandag af maar eintlik werk dit goed saam met die komposisie in die geval. Ek dink die realiteit van die foto was miskien een te veel vir meeste mense wat stem in ''n Free study want die foto is verseker ''n baie hoër punt werd. <br/>Groetnis </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Dankie Rian, groete.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by RianBotes: Goed gesien en goeie werk hier. Ek hou van die beligting en kleure werk goed saam. Sommiges mag dalk se dat die "hot spots'' op regterkant trek aandag af maar eintlik werk dit goed saam met die komposisie in die geval. Ek dink die realiteit van die foto was miskien een te veel vir meeste mense wat stem in ''n Free study want die foto is verseker ''n baie hoër punt werd. Groetnis  Dankie Rian, groete.', '2010-08-09 10:10:44.000000', NULL, 0),
