(6125276, 900679, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> when i made those comments yesterday i didnt realize you''d got the red in the free study .. CONGRATS .. this shot is another amazing image in your huge repertoire  .. you seem to have all genres down pat .. such talent .. :)<br/>hmmmmm .. green ribbon .. ??? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Green: peace, neutral, eco-friendly...<br/>vs. Brown ribbon: the opposite side of blue ribbon.<br/> <br/>What I meant was, hey hihosilver, I don''t have dual personality so I am not able to challenge both blue and brown so I prefer to be with peace if I am really getting bored.<br/> <br/>I think hihosilver misunderstood my meaning. I didn''t mean to challenge DrAchoo or Roz, you know.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-08-11 01:48:13.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by roz: when i made those comments yesterday i didnt realize you''d got the red in the free study .. CONGRATS .. this shot is another amazing image in your huge repertoire  .. you seem to have all genres down pat .. such talent .. :)hmmmmm .. green ribbon .. ???   Green: peace, neutral, eco-friendly...vs. Brown ribbon: the opposite side of blue ribbon. What I meant was, hey hihosilver, I don''t have dual personality so I am not able to challenge both blue and brown so I prefer to be with peace if I am really getting bored. I think hihosilver misunderstood my meaning. I didn''t mean to challenge DrAchoo or Roz, you know.', '2010-08-09 23:04:20.000000', '2010-08-11 02:48:13.000000', 0),
