(6125637, 896942, 117474, '<td valign="top">For votes I think this was the one to pick alright. <br/>It''s not all about the votes though. I''m mostly happy if I get one positive comment from a shot. <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a> seems to sometimes talk about submitting shots that appeal to a certain sub-culture of DPC, and I think he''s happy when they respond to the shot. I''m not sure if I''d feel comfortable doing that yet though.</td>', 'For votes I think this was the one to pick alright. It''s not all about the votes though. I''m mostly happy if I get one positive comment from a shot.  Yo_Spiff seems to sometimes talk about submitting shots that appeal to a certain sub-culture of DPC, and I think he''s happy when they respond to the shot. I''m not sure if I''d feel comfortable doing that yet though.', '2010-08-10 09:27:40.000000', NULL, 0),
