(6126571, 896942, 79720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NiallOTuama:</b></div><hr/><i> For votes I think this was the one to pick alright. <br/>It''s not all about the votes though. I''m mostly happy if I get one positive comment from a shot. <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a> seems to sometimes talk about submitting shots that appeal to a certain sub-culture of DPC, and I think he''s happy when they respond to the shot. I''m not sure if I''d feel comfortable doing that yet though. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Oh, for sure. In the case of this image, it has a broader appeal...dramatic sky, reflections, HDR toning. In the case of the shot I wanted to submit, it might have struck a chord with someone who''s actually <i>seen</i> Avatar (not the crappy movie, but the three seasons of animation heaven). I dunno, I guess I really want another ribbon, then I can be like "pfffft, I''m a multiple ribbon winner, if you don''t get my awesome photography skillz, it''s because YOU suck". :D</td>', 'Originally posted by NiallOTuama: For votes I think this was the one to pick alright. It''s not all about the votes though. I''m mostly happy if I get one positive comment from a shot.  Yo_Spiff seems to sometimes talk about submitting shots that appeal to a certain sub-culture of DPC, and I think he''s happy when they respond to the shot. I''m not sure if I''d feel comfortable doing that yet though.  Oh, for sure. In the case of this image, it has a broader appeal...dramatic sky, reflections, HDR toning. In the case of the shot I wanted to submit, it might have struck a chord with someone who''s actually seen Avatar (not the crappy movie, but the three seasons of animation heaven). I dunno, I guess I really want another ribbon, then I can be like "pfffft, I''m a multiple ribbon winner, if you don''t get my awesome photography skillz, it''s because YOU suck". :D', '2010-08-10 23:14:36.000000', NULL, 0),
