(6149182, 900970, 61651, '<td valign="top">Truly beautiful.  Some sort of sea change must have happened around here for this to end up close to 5.8, and in a Free Study to boot! I really expected to see this at the bottom of the pile.  The voters have summer madness perhaps?  Let''s hope it''s not a fly-by-night fancy and DPC really has changed...in any case, congrats on having this lovely, striking image be so well-received!<br/> <br/>By the way, the other word that comes to mind as I look at this is "Encore!".  Maybe like Monet, you can do multiple studies of this vase, this location, at different times of the day/week/month.  Show us the light.</td>', 'Truly beautiful.  Some sort of sea change must have happened around here for this to end up close to 5.8, and in a Free Study to boot! I really expected to see this at the bottom of the pile.  The voters have summer madness perhaps?  Let''s hope it''s not a fly-by-night fancy and DPC really has changed...in any case, congrats on having this lovely, striking image be so well-received! By the way, the other word that comes to mind as I look at this is "Encore!".  Maybe like Monet, you can do multiple studies of this vase, this location, at different times of the day/week/month.  Show us the light.', '2010-09-01 22:17:59.000000', NULL, 0),
