(6155742, 898583, 28742, '<td valign="top"><i>Ok, here is my 13,000th comment:</i> <br/> <br/>I, too, sometimes have to yank the cup from my grandma''s hands when she falls asleep and won''t let go. :P<br/> <br/><i>hehehe, that was just a warm up.</i> <br/> <br/>I like the image, although from a wedding album perspective I would like to have seen the older woman included in the shot (not just her hands). I suppose the bride won''t forget whose hands they are though. Assuming the younger hands are the bride''s - if not, I would have included both people (faces) in the shot. Then again you may have cropped this for the challenge. As far as the score, it''s very respectable for a FS. In a "Hands" challenge, it would have easily been top 5 or 10 with a 6.8-7.0. Overall, it is a terrific image and I can tell you are very pleased with it, so put it at the top of your own personal personal best list. :-)</td>', 'Ok, here is my 13,000th comment:  I, too, sometimes have to yank the cup from my grandma''s hands when she falls asleep and won''t let go. :P hehehe, that was just a warm up.  I like the image, although from a wedding album perspective I would like to have seen the older woman included in the shot (not just her hands). I suppose the bride won''t forget whose hands they are though. Assuming the younger hands are the bride''s - if not, I would have included both people (faces) in the shot. Then again you may have cropped this for the challenge. As far as the score, it''s very respectable for a FS. In a "Hands" challenge, it would have easily been top 5 or 10 with a 6.8-7.0. Overall, it is a terrific image and I can tell you are very pleased with it, so put it at the top of your own personal personal best list. :-)', '2010-09-08 02:49:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6156392, 900611, 59796, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the wonderful comments all.<br/>This was my first post to DPC and given how things are going, probably will be my best for a while :)<br/>Wonderful honor to be chosen favorite by a couple of you.</td>', 'Thanks for the wonderful comments all.This was my first post to DPC and given how things are going, probably will be my best for a while :)Wonderful honor to be chosen favorite by a couple of you.', '2010-09-08 13:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
