(6159333, 900481, 104809, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I''m into macro, bokeh, and abstracts.  This should have scored at least a point higher (like the average commenter score).  Someone else commented on cropping, but I wonder if that would loose some of the fence to convey your idea.  Worth experimenting on to see what you can do with it and see what you like for yourself.<br/> <br/>Edit: typo fix<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-09-11 18:14:57.</i></td>', 'I like it, but I''m into macro, bokeh, and abstracts.  This should have scored at least a point higher (like the average commenter score).  Someone else commented on cropping, but I wonder if that would loose some of the fence to convey your idea.  Worth experimenting on to see what you can do with it and see what you like for yourself. Edit: typo fix', '2010-09-11 19:13:36.000000', '2010-09-11 19:14:57.000000', 0),
