(6235761, 899014, 108580, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot Rian. Bad luck with the camera. Lucky you didn''t crack your skull!<br/>I''m on the hunt for a 10-20mm or 12-24mm atm in either APS-C or FF. Was in Cape Town for a week and most of my work was done with a Sigma 24-70mm f/2.8 DG Full Frame on DX sensor so not as wide as I''d like.<br/></td>', 'Awesome shot Rian. Bad luck with the camera. Lucky you didn''t crack your skull!I''m on the hunt for a 10-20mm or 12-24mm atm in either APS-C or FF. Was in Cape Town for a week and most of my work was done with a Sigma 24-70mm f/2.8 DG Full Frame on DX sensor so not as wide as I''d like.', '2010-11-28 06:23:14.000000', NULL, 0),
