(6918093, 900792, 3936, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp macro!  The depth of field is perfect.  The subject is fully sharp, and any distractions in the background are completely blurred.  The small amount of noise here, works for me.  It gives this a little bit of gritty reality feel.</td>', 'Nice sharp macro!  The depth of field is perfect.  The subject is fully sharp, and any distractions in the background are completely blurred.  The small amount of noise here, works for me.  It gives this a little bit of gritty reality feel.', '2012-12-01 11:15:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6929925, 900135, 75713, '<td valign="top">Putting the technical aspects aside as this photo transcends those - it tells a wonderful story - I love that the woman isn''t looking at the camera but the little dog is - his/her expression is comical. Best friends indeed.</td>', 'Putting the technical aspects aside as this photo transcends those - it tells a wonderful story - I love that the woman isn''t looking at the camera but the little dog is - his/her expression is comical. Best friends indeed.', '2012-12-11 11:34:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6965082, 896480, 10785, '<td valign="top"><b>Greeting from the Comment Bomb Squad!</b> <br/> <br/>This is a shot that is underappreciated by the commenters and voters alike. The bulding has a striking shape and I love the crane on top as it takes your eye off of the building and into the sunset. But then the beautiful rays of light bring you rigt back on to the subject to complete the circle. The sky has great interest. I think you could have upped the light on the building face in PP to bring out some of those details where it is darkest. But above all the color, shape  and beautiful light make this shot a winner!</td>', 'Greeting from the Comment Bomb Squad!  This is a shot that is underappreciated by the commenters and voters alike. The bulding has a striking shape and I love the crane on top as it takes your eye off of the building and into the sunset. But then the beautiful rays of light bring you rigt back on to the subject to complete the circle. The sky has great interest. I think you could have upped the light on the building face in PP to bring out some of those details where it is darkest. But above all the color, shape  and beautiful light make this shot a winner!', '2013-01-26 20:27:10.000000', NULL, 0),
